---
id: pan-fried-ground-beef
title: Pan-Fried Extra Lean Ground Beef
category: modular_protein

yield:
  servings: 2
  cooked_g: 340

storage:
  fridge_days: 4
  freezer_friendly: true

---

Heat a large non-stick #skillet over medium-high heat.

Add @extra-lean-ground-beef{454%g} directly to the dry skillet without added oil. Season evenly with @kosher-salt{0.5%tsp}, @black-pepper{0.5%tsp}, and @garlic-powder{0.5%tsp}.

Break up the beef with a spatula into small crumbles. Sauté for ~cook-time{7%min}, stirring frequently, until thoroughly browned, rendered juices have reduced, and internal temperature reaches 71°C (160°F) checked with a #meat-thermometer.

Remove from heat and divide the cooked beef equally into 2 meal prep containers (~170 g cooked per portion).
